<title>SWEDEN: Swedish consumer prices rise 0.4 pct m/m in March.</title>
<headline>Swedish consumer prices rise 0.4 pct m/m in March.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish consumer prices rose by 0.4 percent in March from February, Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.</p>
